msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.atexception.register:11
msgid ""
"An identifier is returned which can be used to unregister the exception-"
"handler."
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.atexception.register:14
msgid "This function can be used as a decorator::"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.atexception.register:20
msgid ""
"Notice however that this will bind ``handler`` to the identifier and not "
"the actual exception-handler.  The exception-handler can then be "
"unregistered with::"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.atexception.register:27
msgid "This function is thread safe."
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.atexception.unregister:1
msgid ""
"Remove the exception-handler identified by `ident` from the list of "
"registered handlers.  If `ident` isn't registered this is a no-op."
msgstr ""

